7. Foundation ke liye 10/10 success criteria
Yeh kuch aise tests honge jo main mandatory rakhunga:
- Naya ChatGPT session limited context mein company ko samajh sake.
- Backend agent ko frontend ya doosre confidential project ka unnecessary context na mile.
- Basic GPT/Gemini output ko measurable tests aur project standards se improve kiya ja sake.
- GPT limit khatam hone par saved tasks aur audit wahi se resume hon.
- Bina badlav wali files har baar deep audit na karwani padein.
- Kisi bhi agent ka work history aur decisions traceable hon.
- Sab 8 agents independently operate karein, lekin shared project state maintain karein.
- Owner ke approval ke bina high-risk changes release na hon.
Ek important difference: yeh criteria hamara engineering target hai; current system ko abhi in tests ko pass karna hai. Hum bina evidence ke 10/10 declare nahi karenge.
Mera final decision
Bhai, main tumhe ek giant FOUNDATION.md dekar kaam khatam nahi karunga. Main final architecture isi tarah freeze karne ka recommend karta hoon:
1. Company OS ka machine-readable architecture aur executable foundation.
2. Context Compiler aur incremental audit pehle, taaki GPT ki limitations architecture mein hi handle ho jaayen.
3. Persistent database aur checkpoints, taaki project ki history kabhi sirf chat par depend na ho.
4. Eight independent specialist agents, har ek ka dedicated executable structure.
5. Quality and Refinement Engine, taaki generic model output ko final product na maana jaye.
Aur tumhare fixed development method ke hisaab se main har batch ka complete code isi chat mein dunga; tum GitHub ke browser editor se add/replace karoge. PowerShell sirf chhote patches aur corrections ke liye rakhenge.

Meri nazar mein yahi ab tak ka best, commercially scalable aur ground par implement karne layak plan hai. Isse zyada complex architecture abhi banana unnecessary hoga; pehle F01–F05 ke working implementation se ise prove karna sabse samajhdaar engineering decision hai.






