1. GPT se GitHub par reading kaise hogi?
OpenAI ka official GitHub connector is kaam ke liye hai:
- GPT repository ki permitted files read aur search kar sakta hai.
- File path, function name ya error message ke through relevant code dhoondh sakta hai.
- Har baar poori repository padhne ki zaroorat nahi.
- Changes GitHub par commit hone ke baad updated content dobara retrieve kiya ja sakta hai.
Ek limitation: connector continuous synchronization ya automatic repository index nahi banata. Yeh zaroorat par GitHub se content retrieve karta hai. Aur standard ChatGPT GitHub connector read-only hai; direct writing ke liye Codex alag option hai. 
OpenAI Help Center+1

2. 403 aur 404 ka actual solution
Error	Possible reason	Sahi solution
403	Account ke paas READ permission	Repository owner se Write access
403	App/token mein Contents Write permission missing	Authorized GitHub App/token permission update
403	Rate limit exceeded	Reset ka wait, requests reduce
403	Protected branch	Authorized PR workflow
404	Galat file path ya branch	Exact path, filename aur branch verify
404	Private repository access missing	Correct authorized account
404	File ka naam ya URL encoding galat	Exact GitHub path use

GitHub security ke liye kabhi-kabhi private resource exist hone ke bawajood 404 deta hai. 403 rate limiting ke kaaran bhi aa sakta hai. 
GitHub Docs+2


Tumhare current case ka confirmed issue: prajaktaranjane80-sketch aur sandyranjane-hash dono ko original repository par READ permission mili thi. Isliye 403 ko command badalkar bypass nahi kar sakte.

Original repository mein write ke liye imperiumsandy-commits owner account se login ya authorized account ko Write access dena hoga.
